DESCRIPTION:SKYLER HIGLEY - Skyler Higley is one of the most exciting young
  comedy writers\, known for his biting satire\, subversive wit\, and fascin
 ating back story. He is currently a writer on CBS’ After Midnight and was
  declared by Vulture as one of the Best New and Up And Coming Comedians You
  Need To Know in 2024.\n\nRaised by two white Mormon parents in Salt Lake C
 ity\, Skyler moved to Chicago where he became a mainstay of the iconic come
 dy scene. After contributing to The Onion\, Skyler earned himself a WGA Awa
 rd while on staff at CONAN. He has also contributed to ClickHole and the Ne
 w Yorker and later became a full time writer for The Onion. Skyler was hono
 red as a New Face at the prestigious Montreal Just For Laughs comedy festiv
 al\, was named one of New York Comedy Festival's 'Comics To Watch' and has 
